WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.187 --> 00:00:01.020
(audience applauds)
- All right, y'all,

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.430
I have a great story from social media

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.110
I wanna share before we finish the hour.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.352
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.352 --> 00:00:06.443
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.443 --> 00:00:07.984
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.984 --> 00:00:08.817
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.817 --> 00:00:11.400
So as kids, Gabriela and her
cousins would get together

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.650
for sleepovers at their grandparents

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.900
who they call, Nona and Nono.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.300
They'd eat, dance, play
games, watch movies.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.133
It's a good time.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.300
Now these cousins are all grown up

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.873
and last month they decided
to revive the tradition,

00:00:23.873 --> 00:00:26.550
but they didn't tell Nona or Nono.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.830
They just showed up with
bags and blankets in hand.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.822
Check this out.

00:00:29.822 --> 00:00:32.489
(Italian music)

00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:37.121
(cousin knocking on door)

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:37.954
- [All] Surprise!

00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:40.551
(grandparents laugh)

00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:42.143
[Gabriela] Guess who's sleeping over!

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:44.213
(all cheer)

00:00:44.213 --> 00:00:45.231
Are you happy we're sleeping over?

00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:47.973
- Get the hell out of here!

00:00:47.973 --> 00:00:48.806
You're great!

00:00:48.806 --> 00:00:50.093
I'm sleeping with you guys!

00:00:50.093 --> 00:00:53.760
(all cheering and laughing)

00:00:54.853 --> 00:00:57.390
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.962
- Sweet!

00:00:58.962 --> 00:01:00.510
Such a cute, sweet video

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.970
and it already has 10 million hits online.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.200
Let's catch up with this family

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.790
all watching on NBC New York.

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:06.930
What's up y'all?

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:07.763
- [All] Hi, Kelly!

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:10.263
(audience clapping)

00:01:10.263 --> 00:01:12.123
- Oh, my gosh!

00:01:12.123 --> 00:01:14.670
Well okay, I'm going to
start with Nona and Nono.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.320
What did you think when
they all showed up?

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.660
Were you like, "Wait, what?"

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.093
- Well believe me, I couldn't believe it!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.366
All of a sudden they come in,

00:01:23.366 --> 00:01:25.876
"We're sleeping over,
we're sleeping over!"

00:01:25.876 --> 00:01:28.085
(audience laughs)
Singing the entire music.

00:01:28.085 --> 00:01:29.910
- Aww, I love it so.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:32.070
That's a lot of estrogen,
Nono, I'm just saying.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.164
You're hanging out with a
lot of estrogen. (laughs)

00:01:34.164 --> 00:01:34.997
- Oh.

00:01:34.997 --> 00:01:35.830
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:37.500
- So Gabriela, I got to start with you.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.016
How did the idea come up?

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:40.230
How was the night?

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:41.310
How did it end?

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.992
- So basically, my cousin Christina

00:01:42.992 --> 00:01:45.870
was at my Nona's house on Monday

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.467
and all my Nona kept saying was,

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.167
"I wish you would just sleep over.

00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:51.416
I wish you would just sleep
over," so then we were like

00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:52.249
we knew we were going to go visit,

00:01:52.249 --> 00:01:53.490
'cause we just got back from college,

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.080
so we were like, "All right,
let's go do something.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.947
Lets actually go sleepover
'cause they'll be so surprised."

00:01:58.836 --> 00:02:00.030
We played their favorite music.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.400
We brought chicken parm
and eggplant, gnocchi.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.680
We baked cookies, we played charades,

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.520
we played card games.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.750
It was like the best night.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.310
- I love this so much!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.143
It's so cool!

00:02:09.143 --> 00:02:10.968
(audience clapping)

00:02:10.968 --> 00:02:14.130
You have such a beautiful family!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:14.963
And I love...

00:02:14.963 --> 00:02:15.796
Man, people like...

00:02:15.796 --> 00:02:17.100
I hope their inspired by this.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.150
We should do this more often.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.350
I always have dance parties with my kids,

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:20.460
but they're still seven and nine,

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.390
so I hope we're still doing it

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.827
when they're in their 20s and 30s.

00:02:22.827 --> 00:02:25.650
All right, thank you guys so
much for sharing this video.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.821
Its such a beautiful family video-

00:02:26.821 --> 00:02:27.654
(audience claps)

00:02:27.654 --> 00:02:29.790
and a beautiful experience

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.070
that we should all have with our families.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.470
Good luck, Nono, with all those women!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:37.101
All right, I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:37.101 --> 00:02:37.934
(heart dings)

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:38.910
And that's not all, y'all.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.010
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.540
makers of Precise, the go-to pen

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.440
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.170
wanna honor truly unstoppable
families just like yours,

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:49.200
so they're going to be
writing you a check for $1000.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.033
You can use it for your next sleepover!

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.969
(audience cheering)

00:02:51.969 --> 00:02:54.631
(family cheering)

00:02:54.631 --> 00:02:56.130
(audience applauds)

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.969
Divvy that up, however you will.

00:02:58.969 --> 00:03:00.170
Thank you guys so much!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.479
(audience cheers)

00:03:01.479 --> 00:03:03.130
Thank you to all our guests this hour:

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.530
Common, Alaqua Cox, Ashley, Rob Johnston-

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:07.363
(audience cheers)

00:03:07.363 --> 00:03:08.196
and Lawrence Zarian

00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:10.328
Y'all have a great day,
and if it's not, change it.

